[
  {
    "text": "因诗入狱，被贬黄州。",
    "startMs": 300,
    "endMs": 3200,
    "timestampMs": 300,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "走到人生低谷，他为什么还能说「谁怕」？",
    "startMs": 3467,
    "endMs": 6867,
    "timestampMs": 3467,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "苏轼如何在风雨里，安顿自己。",
    "startMs": 8100,
    "endMs": 10967,
    "timestampMs": 8100,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "1079年，乌台诗案，苏轼因诗入狱。",
    "startMs": 11433,
    "endMs": 15167,
    "timestampMs": 11433,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "次年，他被贬黄州。",
    "startMs": 15467,
    "endMs": 18800,
    "timestampMs": 15467,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "名义上是团练副使，却不得签署公事。",
    "startMs": 19100,
    "endMs": 23033,
    "timestampMs": 19100,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "生活困顿，他开始躬耕东坡。",
    "startMs": 23500,
    "endMs": 27467,
    "timestampMs": 23500,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "在一锄一垄之间，重新安顿自己。",
    "startMs": 27767,
    "endMs": 32133,
    "timestampMs": 27767,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "1082年三月七日，沙湖道中遇雨。",
    "startMs": 32500,
    "endMs": 36767,
    "timestampMs": 32500,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "雨具先去。同行皆狼狈，他却不以为意。",
    "startMs": 37067,
    "endMs": 42000,
    "timestampMs": 37067,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "莫听，不是假装没听见。",
    "startMs": 42500,
    "endMs": 47067,
    "timestampMs": 42500,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "是让外界的喧闹穿耳而过，不留在心里。",
    "startMs": 47400,
    "endMs": 52167,
    "timestampMs": 47400,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "雨再急，也不必把自己交给慌乱。",
    "startMs": 52667,
    "endMs": 56867,
    "timestampMs": 52667,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "难关，总要一步一步走过去。",
    "startMs": 57167,
    "endMs": 61767,
    "timestampMs": 57167,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "竹杖芒鞋，反而比骑马轻快。",
    "startMs": 62167,
    "endMs": 65433,
    "timestampMs": 62167,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "放下对身份与体面的执着，脚下才能轻。",
    "startMs": 65733,
    "endMs": 71667,
    "timestampMs": 65733,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "风雨还在，他却不再退后。",
    "startMs": 72167,
    "endMs": 75733,
    "timestampMs": 72167,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "接纳人生有晴有雨，才有继续走的力量。",
    "startMs": 76033,
    "endMs": 81833,
    "timestampMs": 76033,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "酒醒之后，他也觉得冷。",
    "startMs": 82267,
    "endMs": 86033,
    "timestampMs": 82267,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "从容的人，也有疲惫与脆弱。",
    "startMs": 86300,
    "endMs": 89800,
    "timestampMs": 86300,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "一束斜阳，恰在微冷的时候迎来。",
    "startMs": 90300,
    "endMs": 94867,
    "timestampMs": 90300,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "眼前这场雨，并不是人生的全部。",
    "startMs": 95200,
    "endMs": 99967,
    "timestampMs": 95200,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "回头看，入狱、贬谪、风雨，已在身后。",
    "startMs": 100433,
    "endMs": 104867,
    "timestampMs": 100433,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "归去。过去的遭遇，不必继续定义此刻。",
    "startMs": 105167,
    "endMs": 110967,
    "timestampMs": 105167,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "人生的风波难定，能安顿的是自己的心。",
    "startMs": 111667,
    "endMs": 115600,
    "timestampMs": 111667,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "往前走，带着这份从容。",
    "startMs": 115867,
    "endMs": 119700,
    "timestampMs": 115867,
    "confidence": null
  }
]
